# Register placements and EPR-pair exchange

This module provides the register-placement identities and invariance under
exchanging the EPR pairs. These identities describe the symmetric equivalents
of state-dependent comparisons between measurements on opposite placements.

## References

The placements are blueprint `def:symmetric-equivalents`, and the exchange
identities are `lem:symmetric-equivalents-transfer`; see
`references/qpbt-paper/14_analysis_of_the_pauli_basis_test.tex:420-450`.
-/
